        <activityName xml:lang="en">Wind turbine 3.4MW, onshore, tower</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Wind turbine 3.4MW, onshore, tower
UUID=5fcf18ab-abb5-33d8-abb2-26dce0c5e67a
Wind turbine tower, at site including manufacturing, transports, installation, replacements, decommission and waste treatement. Calculated for FU of 1p.
Data are based on the plant IEA reference 3.4MW onshore wind turbine (Bortolotti et al., 2019; Cooperman et al., 2023).
Assumed lifetime is 25 years.
Location: 
Technology: 
Time period: 
Production volume: 
Sampling: 
Extrapolations: 
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_5fcf18ab-abb5-33d8-abb2-26dce0c5e67a.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
